Addition
- [N1] Added trace (model 2): init(i1) -> action(n2,"trigger: resupply cycle") -> action(n3,"check: inventory level") -> branch(b1,XOR) -> action(n5,"create: purchase order") -> action(n6,"review: purchase order") -> branch(b2,XOR) -> converge(c_rework) -> action(n7,"rework: purchase order") -> action(n8,"review: purchase order") -> branch(b3,XOR) -> converge(c_sync) -> branch(b4,AND) -> action(n12,"send to supplier") -> converge(c1) -> action(n10,"receive packing slip and release funds") -> end(e1)
- [N2] Added trace (model 4): init(i1) -> action(n2,"trigger: resupply cycle") -> action(n3,"check: inventory level") -> branch(b1,XOR) -> action(n5,"create: purchase order") -> action(n6,"review: purchase order") -> branch(b2,XOR) -> converge(c_sync) -> branch(b4,AND) -> action(n12,"send to supplier") -> converge(c1) -> action(n10,"receive packing slip and release funds") -> end(e1)
